# .agy Blueprint & Guardrails for ModelStudio IDE
ProjectName: ModelStudio IDE
Repository: ash-forge/model-studio-ide
Architecture: C# .NET 10 WPF Desktop & Core Binary Parsing Engine
CoreCapability: Zero-copy memory mapped GGUF/SafeTensors/ONNX/TFLite visual IDE and precision tuner
Guardrails:
- Cross-platform C# code targeting Windows, Linux, and macOS
- Zero hardcoded local file paths or machine-specific drive letters
- Sub-309ms binary header parsing using MemoryMappedFile
